<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TEREXKO HALF YEAR RESULTS BELOW BUDGET.</title>
<headline>TEREXKO HALF YEAR RESULTS BELOW BUDGET.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     13.1	  vs 37.7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.32	  vs 12.64</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.68	  vs 1.09</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.19	  vs 1.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		  30.72	 vs 57.87</p>
<p>Full name: Terexko Ltd</p>
<p>    Operating profit	5.07	  vs 14.22</p>
<p>NOTE - Conference to hotels firm Terexko, which was posting</p>
<p>maiden results after listing late last year, said that the</p>
<p>comparative figures were proforma and for the year to June 30,</p>
<p>1996.</p>
<p>The group added that its latest results were below budget</p>
<p>expectations due to conferences being cancelled in a highly</p>
<p>competitive market.</p>
<p>It added its Vilamoura restaurnts and hotels were performing</p>
<p>as anticipated.</p>
<p>The firm said its profit forecast in its flotation</p>
<p>prospectus was unlikely to be achieved. </p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
